installed package tree, and every mutable Python startup component beside them,
then launches the worker with the one fixed site-disabled argument vector so
that no ``.pth`` hook, ``sitecustomize``, ``usercustomize``, per-user site
directory, or launcher-directory import can execute at all.  The worker proves
its isolation flags, import path, and complete loaded-module set back to the
manager, and any component inserted or mutated across the launch boundary is a
detected worker-identity change.
